      "updated": 1792984048537,
      "created": 1792982367847,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Team creation screen:\n- Host can name teams, or  team\ncaptains can (first person on each\nteam)\n- Can click + button beside team to\nselect a person or a random one\n    - if random, does wheel of names\nanimation with confetti\n- Can click '-' button beside a person\nto remove them from a team\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "_6MLG0uwMuo0Mb118iH5b",
      "originalText": "Team creation screen:\n- Host can name teams, or  team captains can (first person on each team)\n- Can click + button beside team to select a person or a random one\n    - if random, does wheel of names animation with confetti\n- Can click '-' button beside a person to remove them from a team\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
